[TITLE]
QA Phase 3-exfilgeom — TABULAR storage + exfiltration (curve geometry path).
Exercises ExfilSolver::init's TABULAR branch: storage_curve read via the
side-table (sr from storage_row), wide fallback. Exfil + seep set via C-API.

